          "code": "ORGANIZE_RESULTS",
          "id": "1768340055004",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1768340055007_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Display the value of {{$context.$nodes.INCIDENT_LOOP.$output}} by combining all the suggestions for each role. Display the role and suggestion only.\n\nGroup information consistently, organized by role, and using bullet points for recommended new roles based on entitlements. Include only one recommended role per entitlement. Do not include the number with parenthesis in the name of the recommended new role. Do not include information about specific users who have the role. There should be no role based on a GlobalUserName or user.\n\nSample format:\nCurrent Role: name of role\nRecommended New Roles:\n- Bullet list of recommended new roles\n\nOutput format:\nOutput as json"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
